# Flutter: U1's D2 stuck at 1: the CPU reads $EE (INC absolute) instead of $EA (NOP). Each INC reads
# $EEEE and writes it back twice, so the address sits at $EEEE half the time and RW pulses although
# nothing should ever be written. The lights show 1110 in every group of four.
machine heartbeat
title "Flutter"
brief "The lights stop counting: they all glow at once, D1, D5, D9 and D13 dim and the others bright, the same whatever happens. Reset changes nothing."
fault stuck U1.D2 1
